1. What Is the Solution? (In Simple Words)
The solution is to build one simple web application called Maverick Certify.
👉 This application will replace manual certificate work (Excel + emails + follow‑ups) with one system that does everything automatically.
In short, Maverick Certify will:

Take a list of candidates (from Excel)
Automatically create certificates for them
Send certificates by email
Track who received the certificate
Track who shared it on LinkedIn
Show all this clearly in one dashboard

So instead of people manually making certificates and tracking things in sheets, the system does it for them.

2. What Problem Does It Solve? (Plain Explanation)
Right now:

Certificates are made manually → takes a lot of time
Data is stored in Excel → errors and confusion
Emails are sent manually → no tracking
LinkedIn posts are not tracked → branding opportunity is wasted

Your solution fixes this by:

Automating everything
Putting all data in one place
Showing clear status (done / pending)
Helping the company get better visibility on LinkedIn


